  "published": "2026-10-03T22:09:21.773Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v8.3.0: Minor-version policy exception: includes a breaking diagnostics-interface migration. Uses optional IVectorStoreDiagnostics for chunk lookup, full query scoring and health checks. Retains legacy custom IRagDiagnosticsStore implementations through RAG.Abstractions 6.5.0. Requires InMemory 4.3.0, which no longer implements the old RAG interface; update casts to IVectorStoreDiagnostics. Normal RAG indexing/retrieval and limited diagnostics for stores without the capability remain available. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/rag/Mythosia.AI.Rag/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v830",
